goalstate     | wait_standby
rule_pos      | 
rule_section  | 
description   | New state is reported by node 25 "lafm_s1" (lafm_s1:5432): "wait_standby"
-[ RECORD 4 ]-+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
reportedstate | single
goalstate     | wait_primary
rule_pos      | 401
rule_section  | primary_node
description   | primary alone, another node reached wait_standby -> wait_primary
-[ RECORD 5 ]-+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
reportedstate | wait_primary
goalstate     | wait_primary
rule_pos      | 
